# tree-todo
===
 Tree Todo is a cross-platform (Windows, MacOS, Linux) desktop tree to-do application. It combines the \"infinite level dismantling\" of the mind map and the \"status tracking\" of the to-do list: any node can create unlimited child nodes, any node can be completed or canceled, and the status is automatically propagated along the tree. ..
